## SCORING FRAMEWORK

**Criteria and Weighting:**

| Criterion | Weight |
|---|---|
| Magnitude of problem facing the NHS in winter | 20% |
| Strength of evidence underpinning the intervention | 20% |
| Cost-effectiveness considerations | 15% |
| Alignment with NHS Plan and UK Life Sciences Strategy | 15% |
